"View coverage" = "Couverture des vues";
"Live 3D preview" = "Aperçu 3D en direct";
"Observed points · provisional" = "Points observés · provisoire";
"The first observations will appear here." = "Les premières observations apparaîtront ici.";
"One gentle orbit" = "Un tour en douceur";
