"Association code received. Link this dish before scanning." = "Code reçu. Associez ce plat avant de scanner.";

"Film around your dish. We prepare the photos. Your PC builds the 3D model." = "Filme autour de ton plat. Nous préparons les photos. Ton PC calcule le modèle 3D.";
"Film your dish" = "Filmer mon plat";
